Third-party software used (not vendored; installed as dependencies):

- liboqs, Open Quantum Safe project (MIT). Falcon-512 implementation.
  https://github.com/open-quantum-safe/liboqs
- @openforge-sh/liboqs (MIT), Copyright (c) 2025 openforge-sh. WebAssembly
  build of liboqs used by the TypeScript package (and by the Falcon wallet).
- @noble/hashes (MIT), Copyright (c) Paul Miller. SHA-256 and RIPEMD-160.
- pqcrypto-falcon / pqcrypto-traits (MIT OR Apache-2.0), wrapping the PQClean
  Falcon-512 reference code. Used by the Rust crate, as by the Falcon PL node.
- sha2, hex, serde, serde_json (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Rust crate.

The account address encoding follows the XRP Ledger classic-address format
(base58check, XRPL alphabet), reimplemented here; no XRPL source is copied.

